{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人梁杰文於節目中推介萬洲國際(288)，形容股份算是半隻內需股，目前內需股半塊走勢仍好，而萬洲估值便宜，預測市盈率8倍，同時股息率有逾7%，可以博追落後。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PIJkuoy4zg1795586535.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>梁杰文建議6.57元買入，目標價看7.5元，止蝕價定於5.8元。</p><p>萬洲國際(288)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$6.57</p><p>目標：$7.5</p><p>止蝕：$5.8</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262IPF57bRHe1795586533.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>股評人李澤銘推介聯想集團(992)，指黃仁勳復職輝行政總裁，紓緩市場對AI投資中斷的恐慌，而聯想有逾七成半收入來自海外，不太受美國晶片限制所影響，始終AI需求足以維持高增長。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JLSZVThV2Z1795586531.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李澤銘原本建議17.4元才部署，最後改為現價16.89元買入，目標價看23.8元，止蝕價定於15元。</p><p></p><p>聯想集團(992)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$16.89入</p><p>目標：$23.8</p><p>止蝕：$15</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.101892+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:49:20.968650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:17.139174+00:00","content_hash":"e73a0b5182e1343729df2e4b5fd98d5538d103bfa6963885442d126ab3bb8080","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.101892+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}